  "scope": "Unchanged SkullManager (with SkullIcon and the anonymous deep-wilderness ContainerListener), HintIconManager, WarningMessages (with WarningMessage), AssistSession (with its anonymous CloseEvent), RequestModule, AchievementDiaryManager, AchievementDiary, DiaryType, DiaryLevel, Bar, the HintIcon writer with HintIconContext, IoBuffer, PacketHeader, Context, OutgoingPacket, CloseEvent, ContainerListener, MapDistance and the timer framework (RSTimer, PersistTimer, TimerFlag, TimerManager and the Skulled timer) on JDK 11 with Kotlin 1.8.20, kotlin-reflect 1.6.10 (compile only), json-simple 1.1.1 and the published ConstLib 1.4.28 (Items). Original text inserted at generation time: Player.debug and hasItem, Item.getAlchemyValue(), the GlobalData assist accessors, EquipmentContainer's slot constants, WildernessZone.WILDERNESS_PROT_ATTR, the Skills ids, Location.withinDistance and getDistance, ContentAPI registerTimer, spawnTimer and removeTimer. Recording adapters: Entity, Player and NPC (attributes and extensions as maps, appearance, locks, ironman restriction, username, artificial flag, messages), the three containers (host model: slots of id and amount; containsItem sums, remove takes from the first slots, add fills the first empty slot; listener lists record add and remove), Item names, ItemDefinition.getAlchemyValue, NPCDefinition names, Component (with Component.close running its event), the InterfaceManager (one opened field; close runs the opened component's event), PacketDispatch sendMessage/sendString/sendInterfaceConfig/sendRunScript, the session (zero ISAAC, frames recorded as bytes), setVarp, playAudio, getWorldTicks (0), log, TimerRegistry.getTimerInstance (Skulled under \"skulled\"), Skills refresh/getLevel/addExperience, Pulse construction, the world pulser, Animation, Graphics and ServerConstants.ENHANCED_DEEP_WILDERNESS. AssistSession's System is a same-package clock class (the case's time; the source text is unchanged). AchievementDiary.completedLevels is cleared before each case. Not exercised: TimerManager.processTimers running a due timer (no case reaches a due tick), the real InterfaceManager, packets other than HintIcon, and the content that calls these classes.",
